- **Timing:** one manual start-up took 0.024 s, well inside the spec's 1 s limit.

**Status is `DONE_WITH_CONCERNS`, for one thing you need to act on:** beta now fails to start unless alpha can be imported. `beta/README.md` still gives the unit-test command without `PYTHONPATH`, so following it now fails. The README isn't one of this task's files, so I left it alone; updating it would need its own task.

I committed only the two task files, and nothing process-related went into the code repo. The report also has two suggestions for the tester: output order with `--count-lines`, and what happens when alpha can't be imported.

